Package: oofzf
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign interactive fuzzy finder and candidate ranker
 A fuzzy finder and candidate ranker written in pure openOODA, featuring
 negative-trust capability security, ANSI scoring, oote palettes, and
 streaming MCP stdio surface with 4 tools.
